    {
      "id": "0a730820-1438-409c-b3bd-1b68d2eb27b7",
      "name": "Why MCP is Awesome: Unlocking AI Integration",
      "path": "Blog / Why MCP is Awesome: Unlocking AI Integration",
      "docTypeId": "7ba9b66f-dfec-4427-bb3a-afc61a8f6b30",
      "templateId": "607188fb-3231-4207-ba84-9bdc0f97293d",
      "state": "Published",
      "domains": [],
      "values": [
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextBox",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "title",
          "value": "Why MCP is Awesome: Unlocking AI Integration"
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.DateTime",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "publishedDate",
          "value": "2026-09-29 00:00:00"
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.MediaPicker3",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "featuredImage",
          "value": [
            {
              "key": "7e2b5cf7-1f4b-411d-b73a-8be4e898f34d",
              "mediaKey": "7e2b5cf7-1f4b-411d-b73a-8be4e898f34d",
              "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
              "crops": [],
              "focalPoint": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "content",
          "value": {
            "markup": "<p><strong>MCP (Model Context Protocol)</strong> is revolutionizing how AI systems interact with tools and data. It provides a standardized way for large language models to understand and utilize external tools, databases, and services.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul><li><strong>Standardized Tool Access</strong>: MCP creates a common protocol for AI systems to discover and use tools.</li><li><strong>Enhanced Automation</strong>: Seamlessly integrate AI capabilities into your existing workflows.</li><li><strong>Content Management Integration</strong>: Tools like the Umbraco MCP server enable AI agents to directly manage content, media, and document types.</li><li><strong>Multi-Agent Orchestration</strong>: Build complex workflows where multiple AI agents collaborate using MCP as the communication bridge.</li></ul><p>With MCP, the possibilities are endless. Imagine AI agents that can automatically create content, manage media libraries, and orchestrate complex editorial workflows - all while maintaining your content governance standards.</p>",
            "blocks": {
              "layout": {},
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": []
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "urls": [
        "/why-mcp-is-awesome-unlocking-ai-integration/"
      ],
      "docType": "blogPostPage",
      "template": "blogPostPage"
    },
    {
      "id": "ef557bd5-ff80-4c2a-b572-867e3a7415bc",
      "name": "MCP Transforms Content Management",
      "path": "Blog / MCP Transforms Content Management",
      "docTypeId": "7ba9b66f-dfec-4427-bb3a-afc61a8f6b30",
      "templateId": "607188fb-3231-4207-ba84-9bdc0f97293d",
      "state": "Published",
      "domains": [],
      "values": [
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.TextBox",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "title",
          "value": "MCP Transforms Content Management"
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.DateTime",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "publishedDate",
          "value": "2026-09-29 00:00:00"
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.MediaPicker3",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "featuredImage",
          "value": [
            {
              "key": "e767e70b-5063-4555-b1df-de5b941f5d0d",
              "mediaKey": "e767e70b-5063-4555-b1df-de5b941f5d0d",
              "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
              "crops": [],
              "focalPoint": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "editorAlias": "Umbraco.RichText",
          "culture": null,
          "segment": null,
          "alias": "content",
          "value": {
            "markup": "<p>The Model Context Protocol is not just another API standard - it's a fundamental shift in how content management systems will operate in the AI era.</p><h3>The Content Management Revolution</h3><p>Traditional content management workflows have relied on manual processes and human decision-making. MCP changes this by enabling AI systems to understand and participate in these workflows directly.</p><h4>Smart Content Operations</h4><ul><li><strong>Automated Content Creation</strong>: AI agents can generate, edit, and organize content using the Umbraco MCP server.</li><li><strong>Intelligent Media Management</strong>: Automatic image optimization, tagging, and organization.</li><li><strong>Document Type Modeling</strong>: AI can help design optimal content structures based on your content strategy.</li><li><strong>Real-time Publishing Workflows</strong>: Seamlessly integrate approval processes with AI assistance.</li></ul><h3>Building the Future</h3><p>The Umbraco MCP server demonstration shows what's possible when content systems embrace AI-native protocols. By exposing content structure through MCP, Umbraco enables a new class of AI-powered content management tools and workflows that were previously impossible.</p>",
            "blocks": {
              "layout": {},
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": []
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "urls": [
        "/mcp-transforms-content-management/"
      ],
